comment16.params=
comment16.target=void\ levelUp()
comment16.text=\n\ Increase\ level\ every\ time\ when\ the\ ball\ bounced\ 10\ times\ on\ the\ Paddle.\ When\ it\ reaches\ 10\ times,\ speed\ grows\ by\ 1\ and\ levelUp\ sound\ is\ played.\n
comment17.params=
comment17.target=void\ bounceOfPaddle()
comment17.text=\n\ Check\ if\ the\ ball\ is\ bounced\ and\ its\ rotation\ less\ then\ 180.\ If\ that\ is\ true,\ the\ ball\ revert\ verically\ and\ bounced\ counter\ increase\ by\ 1.\ \n
comment18.params=
comment18.target=void\ bounceOfSelfPaddle()
comment18.text=\n\ Check\ if\ the\ ball\ is\ bounced\ and\ its\ rotation\ more\ then\ 180,\ than\ the\ ball\ revert.\ \n
